AI Grounded
Copyright 2026 Myoung Hong

This project was originally created by Myoung Hong in May 2026
as a spec-driven development template integrating GitHub spec-kit, a
7-article project constitution, twelve specialized AI sub-agents with
enforced loop closure between upstream challengers and downstream
verifiers, and a governance substrate covering OSCAL compliance catalogs,
threat catalogs, Cedar policies, attestation specs, and incident response
playbooks.

The original works of authorship contributed by Myoung Hong
include but are not limited to:

  - The 7-article project constitution
  - The twelve specialized sub-agent definitions
  - The agent coordination protocol and loop-closure architecture
  - The governance-commons structured representations
  - The customizations to spec-kit's spec template
  - All documentation in this repository unless otherwise noted

